{"id":276606907204495,"type":"album","name":"Immunity","artist":"Jon Hopkins","year":2013,"weight":31,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/2013/7574-immunity-1.jpg","aoty":84,"aoty_user":83,"sputnik":4.08,"yt":"sVefn-AXoZw","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/jon-hopkins/immunity","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/7574-jon-hopkins-immunity.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/131609/Jon-Hopkins-Immunity/"},"desc":"A powerful, multi-faceted beast, packed with the most aggressively dancefloor-focused music Hopkins has ever made, \"Immunity\" is about achieving euphoric states through music. Inspired by the arc of an epic night out, the album peaks with \"Collider\", a huge, apocalyptic, techno monster and dissolves with the quiet, heartbreakingly beautiful closer, \"Immunity\", a track featuring vocals from King Creosote which could sit comfortably alongside the gems of their Mercury-nominated collaboration, \"Diamond Mine\". Immunity is a confident, dramatic record defined by an acute sense of physicality and place.  It feels like the hypnotic accompaniment to a journey of creativity, a trip inside ."},"artist_ref":{"id":115975597308511,"name":"Jon Hopkins","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/JonHopkins2010.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":87625349211221,"type":"genre","name":"electronic","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1332,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":198176882370097,"type":"genre","name":"Techno","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":820,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":184262862830389,"type":"genre","name":"IDM","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":387,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":242119982771334,"type":"genre","name":"Electro","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":345,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":56177319906220,"type":"genre","name":"electronica","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":262,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":7011